=== 3. raising a quotation sets QUOTED; a DROPPED inquiry can be quoted; two quotes per inquiry ===
    after quote 1: {"id":4,"inquiry_no":"INQ-00004","status":"QUOTED","client_id":666,"subject":"Need TPI"}  #1 Q-00001 r0 cur=1 DRAFT total=59000 contract=-
    after quote 2 (alternative offer): {"id":4,"inquiry_no":"INQ-00004","status":"QUOTED","client_id":666,"subject":"Need TPI"}  #2 Q-00002 r0 cur=1 DRAFT total=59000 contract=-  quotes on inquiry=2
    [inquiry-edit -> DROPPED] success: Inquiry updated.
    {"id":5,"inquiry_no":"INQ-00005","status":"DROPPED","client_id":666,"subject":"S"}
    quote raised on the DROPPED inquiry: #3 Q-00003 r0 cur=1 DRAFT total=59000 contract=- -> inquiry {"id":5,"inquiry_no":"INQ-00005","status":"QUOTED","client_id":666,"subject":"S"}
    [inquiry-edit QUOTED -> OPEN while 2 quotes exist] success: Inquiry updated.
    {"id":4,"inquiry_no":"INQ-00004","status":"OPEN","client_id":666,"subject":"S"}
    [the only quote is LOST] success: Quotation moved to Lost / regretted.
