    quote with inquiry_id=999999 (no such inquiry): #5 Q-00005 r0 cur=1 DRAFT total=59000 contract=- inquiry_id=999999

=== 4. delete ===
    [inquiry-delete with quotes (MM)] error: You can open CRM — Inquiries, but you do not have permission to delete here. Ask your administrator for the "Delete" tick on CRM — Inquiries.
    [inquiry-delete with quotes (ADMIN)] error: A quote has been raised against INQ-00004, so it is part of the record and cannot be deleted. Set its status to Dropped instead.
    [inquiry-delete, no quote (BM, admin-level)] success: Inquiry INQ-00003 deleted.
    is there any quote-delete route? no

